{"about_the_game":"<strong>Void Inside</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game<br><br><br>In a world devastated by radiation, the surface of the Earth has turned into a lifeless wasteland. <br>People long ago sought refuge in underground shelters, but even there, death caught up with them through disease. The protagonist is the last survivor in his shelter <br><br>He is completely alone, surrounded by silence and the bodies of those he once knew. After many days of despair, he decides that staying any longer is meaningless. He leaves the shelter and boards a monorail, not knowing where it leads or what awaits him ahead<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>An atmosphere of claustrophobia and hopelessness<br></li><li>Horror conveyed through sounds and the sense of presence<br></li><li>The monorail as a symbol of the final refuge</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2015450?t=1767905775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2015450?t=1767905775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015450/aeec7aa3e2d92ddd4ec95923a9be2f151c1e03f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767905775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2015450/aeec7aa3e2d92ddd4ec95923a9be2f151c1e03f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767905775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3962060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<strong>Void Inside</strong> is a first-person psychological horror game<br><br><br>In a world devastated by radiation, the